# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generative_AI_Research_49916100 -- files that must never reach the remote
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rule of thumb: GitHub is the version-controlled home for code, documentation
# and de-identified data only. Anything identifiable, licensed or very large
# lives in UQ RDM and is referenced from here by a pointer file.

# --- Identifiable and restricted human-participant data --------------------
03_qualitative/consent/*.pdf
03_qualitative/consent/*.docx
03_qualitative/consent/*.jpg
03_qualitative/transcripts/identifiable/*
05_additional_materials/recordings/*
05_additional_materials/photos/*.jpg
05_additional_materials/photos/*.jpeg
05_additional_materials/photos/*.png
05_additional_materials/photos/*.heic
!**/README.md

# --- Re-identification risk: the linkage key between ID and participant ----
**/*participant-key*
**/*linkage*
**/*_IDENTIFIABLE*

# --- Copyright: publisher PDFs may not be redistributed -------------------
01_literature/**/*.pdf

# --- Credentials and configuration ----------------------------------------
.env
*.key
*.pem
credentials*.json
config.local.*

# --- Large or regenerable outputs ------------------------------------------
*.sav
*.nvp
*.nvpx
*.zip
*.7z
02_quantitative/data/interim/*
!02_quantitative/data/interim/README.md

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editor, OS and Office lock files -------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pptx
.vscode/
.idea/
